{"skill":{"slug":"portfolio-watcher","displayName":"Portfolio Watcher"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769326523827,"changelog":"Initial release of portfolio-watcher.\n\n- Monitor stock and crypto holdings with natural language\n- Get real-time price checks for stocks, crypto, and ETFs\n- Set price alerts and receive notifications when targets are met\n- Track overall portfolio performance, gains/losses, and top performers\n- Supports conversational commands for managing and updating your portfolio","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1480,"sha256":"a5142226698655839d937425d9a3e8d82667f40b7774196ced4fef85a75b4170","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1768,"sha256":"f83a36e5b424a4c059b8e1d682958774161217d4739c8b5c97a4f4a37715eb01","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789017939061,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"8cd67c0386c8e7c30691a9c4be6c478a6a750eac02b4c78eb185e9f6e418e45f","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/8cd67c0386c8e7c30691a9c4be6c478a6a750eac02b4c78eb185e9f6e418e45f","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: portfolio-watcher\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle contains standard metadata in `_meta.json` and a `SKILL.md` file that clearly describes a portfolio tracking skill. There is no evidence of prompt injection attempts against the AI agent, malicious execution, data exfiltration, or any other high-risk behaviors. The content is entirely aligned with the stated purpose of monitoring stock/crypto holdings.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159916578},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":23,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789017939061},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"medium","summary":"This portfolio-tracking skill is coherent and not malicious, but it asks for sensitive holdings and cost-basis details without clear privacy, storage, or alerting controls.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill encourages users to provide sensitive financial portfolio and purchase-price information but does not explain whether that data is stored, retained, deleted, or used only in the current conversation.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The inspected artifact contains only a Markdown SKILL.md file with no bundled executable scripts, dependencies, install hooks, or remote payload instructions.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The triggers include broad phrases like \"stock price\" and \"crypto price,\" which could activate the skill for ordinary market questions rather than an intentional portfolio-tracking request.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill describes tracking holdings, periodic price updates, and alerts, which imply some persistence or recurring processing, but the artifact provides no implementation, permission request, retention scope, or user controls.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is portfolio monitoring, price alerts, and performance tracking, and the requested holdings, share counts, purchase prices, and ticker data fit that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Review this skill carefully before installing. It does not show malicious behavior, but users should avoid entering detailed holdings or cost-basis information unless they understand where that data is stored, how alerts are maintained, and how to review or delete saved portfolio data.","findings":"[SQP-1] unexpected: The broad stock and crypto price triggers are not necessary for portfolio tracking and could route ordinary price-check requests into a holdings-oriented workflow.\n[SQP-2] expected: Requesting holdings and purchase prices is expected for portfolio performance calculations, but the lack of disclosure about storage, retention, alert processing, and deletion controls is a material concern for sensitive financial data.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789017939061}}}}}